Error [E0771]: this needs fn(Int) =[IO]=>, but the function value is fn(n: Int)
  --> tests/ui/effect_via_unknown_param.jet:12:15
    |
 12 |     invoke(5, show)
    |               ^^^^
 Why: public labels and parameter zones are part of a function's callable type
 Fix: use `fn(Int) =[IO]=>` here

Error [E0748]: `=[via missing]=>` on `invoke` names no such parameter
  --> tests/ui/effect_via_unknown_param.jet:3:47
    |
  3 | fn invoke(n: Int, act: fn(Int) =[IO]=>) =[via missing]=> {
    |                                               ^^^^^^^
 Why: `=[via f]=>` publishes the effects of a callback parameter `f`; `invoke` has no parameter called `missing`
 Fix: name one of `invoke`'s callback parameters after `via`
